#. ~ Description of "energy-effective pump sources"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of improved electric discharges, that uses energy more efficiently then"
" standard.  It makes you spend much less energy per shot, but the overall "
"output of a system is a bit smaller."
msgstr ""

