msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "freezing heat sink"
#. ~ Description of "freezing heat sink"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A small piece of completely frozen metal.  It grants a massive cooling "
"improvement, but the weapon circuits don't work properly with this mod, "
"making you spend more energy per shot."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
