#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A sheet so light and thin that viewing it horizontally makes it almost invisible.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "spiked sphere"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A prickly ball that, no matter the force you apply, somehow never feels as if it could cut.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""

