#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"Despite its looseness, this mass of goo keeps its shape as you fold it in your hands.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "spiraling rod"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A rod with a bulbous, spiralling knob on the end that seems to spin as you look.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""

