#. ~ Description of "Goody Osborne's Booke of Remedies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid ""
"This purports to be the 'Reale and True Acounting of the Works and Devices of"
" Sarah Osbourne, a Most Puissant Wiche', but you're pretty sure it's all a "
"front and it was actually written within the last couple decades.  There are "
"some pretty detailed descriptions of rituals in here, mixed among diary "
"entries and accounts of fanciful meetings in the woods."
msgstr ""

